ReadyToRun images for witos (plan step R9): the runtime pack's ReadyToRun compilation writes a perf map, whose
signature names the target's operating system, and TargetOS.WitOS had no token, so the compilation stopped with
NotImplementedException. A witos image is a Linux one to the runtime (pedecoder.h) and to crossgen2's machine field
(TargetExtensions.cs), and its perf map says Linux too.

--- a/src/coreclr/tools/aot/ILCompiler.Diagnostics/PerfMapWriter.cs
